    "detailedExplanationEn": "🎯 Correct Answer: Option A (\"5 euros\")\n\n• Textual Evidence (Annonce de fleuriste):\nIn response to \"How much does a tulip bouquet cost this weekend?\", the passage states: \"MARKET FLOWERS — SPRING SALE: All tulip and daffodil bouquets at 5 euros this weekend. Free downtown delivery for purchases over 20 euros.\".\nOption A (\"5 euros\") accurately conveys the essential information presented in the text.\n\n• Detailed Distractor Breakdown (Incorrect Options):\n  - Option A (\"5 euros\") [CORRECT]: Accurately conveys the verified information from the document without distortion.\n  - Option B (\"3 euros\") [INCORRECT - NUMERICAL OR TEMPORAL DISTRACTOR TRAP]: Uses inaccurate numerical or temporal anchors (\"3 euros\") that distort explicit passage figures.\n  - Option C (\"10 euros\") [INCORRECT - NUMERICAL OR TEMPORAL DISTRACTOR TRAP]: Uses inaccurate numerical or temporal anchors (\"10 euros\") that distort explicit passage figures.\n  - Option D (\"20 euros\") [INCORRECT - NUMERICAL OR TEMPORAL DISTRACTOR TRAP]: Uses inaccurate numerical or temporal anchors (\"20 euros\") that distort explicit passage figures."
